  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Grassroot funds and women-led Community-based organisations for Gender-Just Climate Solutions in Latin America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In addition to coordinate GAGGA programme, FCAM is mobilising resources for women&#x2019;s funds and CBOs advocating for Gender-Just Climate Solutions in Latin America. FCAM is a women&#x2019;s fund based in Central America at the frontlines of intersectional work on women&#x2019;s rights, gender equality, environmental and climate justice activism. It brings a unique perspective and proven capacity demonstrating that a feminist organisation from Latin American can effectively coordinate global programmes and mobilise significant resources while bringing the perspective of local young and adult women&#x2019;s groups from the Global South to the forefront.</narrative>
  </description>
